GitHub Actions with Kubernetes

Today I learned how GitHub Actions automates Kubernetes deployments for modern cloud-native applications.

🔹 Kubeconfig Usage
Workflows use kubeconfig to:
Authenticate with clusters
Select namespaces
Apply configurations
Access is handled securely.

🔹 Deploy Manifests
GitHub Actions can:
Apply Kubernetes YAML manifests
Deploy services and workloads
Automate release processes
This ensures consistent deployments.

🔹 Rolling Updates
Rolling updates help:
Update pods gradually
Avoid downtime
Enable safer releases
Automation improves reliability.

🔥 3-Line Takeaway
CI/CD reaches clusters.
 Manifests define state.
 Rolling updates ensure uptime.
